    <span class="asof"><span class="pfx">{{ t('as of', '截至') }} </span>{{ d.as_of }} · {{ t('vs', '对标') }} {{ t(d.bench_label, d.bench_label_zh) }}</span>
  </div>
  <p class="tagline">{{ t(
	    'Find the leading theme, hold it while trend is healthy, and raise cash when risk breaks. Discipline, not prediction.',
